OL,3,GNEWSAWoman injured as car stolen while 
OL,4,Ashe was de-icing it                    
OL,6,FA woman was injured after thieves stole
OL,7,Fher car in East Lothian as she was     
OL,8,Fde-icing it early on Saturday morning. 
OL,10,FThe 44-year-old had been defrosting her
OL,11,FMazda in Preston Avenue, Prestonpans,  
OL,12,Fat about 06:45 when she was approached 
OL,13,Fby two men.                            
OL,15,FThey got into the car and drove off but
OL,16,Fas she tried to stop them, the woman   
OL,17,Fwas hit by the vehicle. She was taken  
OL,18,Fto the Royal Infirmary of Edinburgh for
OL,19,Ftreatment.                             
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
