OL,3,GNEWSAWoman injured as car stolen while 
OL,4,Ashe was de-icing it                    
OL,6,FThe car was dark-blue Mazda CX-5 with  
OL,7,Fthe registration number SR16 AVM. It   
OL,8,Fwas recovered by police in Delta Drive,
OL,9,FMusselburgh on Sunday but its          
OL,10,Fregistration plates had been changed to
OL,11,FCH55 ROY.                              
